// Expected exit: 11
// Both files export run and Reader. A Build helper selects the entry in left/left.omg,
// carries the compiler-issued description back, and binds that exact entry.
// Its selected Reader implementation returns 11; the entry in right/right.omg would
// exit 37, and losing the provider result or branch would exit 65.
use left/left.omg;
use right/right.omg;
